<title>INDONESIA: SOCCER-INDONESIA AND UZBEKISTAN DRAW IN QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-INDONESIA AND UZBEKISTAN DRAW IN QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia and Uzbekistan drew 1-1 in their World Cup soccer Asian zone group 5 qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Indonesia - Sudirman 34</p>
<p>Uzbekistan - Oleg Shatskikh 72</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
<p>    Standings		P   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> Uzbekistan		  3   2   1   0   8   1   7</p>
<p> Yemen			 4   2   1   1   8   1   7</p>
<p> Indonesia		   4   1   3   0  10   2   6</p>
<p> Cambodia		    5   0   1   4   1  23   1</p>
<p>Remaining matches: June 13 Yemen v Indonesia, June 20 Uzbekistan v Indonesia, June 29 Cambodia v Uzbekistan, July 13 Uzbekistan v Yemen.</p>
</text>
